  "prefLabel": "Man 211.03 Decision on Motion for Rehearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Man 211.03 Decision on Motion for Rehearing. The board shall grant or deny a motion for rehearing, or suspend the order or decision pending further consideration at the next scheduled board meeting after receipt of the motion for rehearing.\n\nSource. #8286-A, eff 2-16-05; ss by #10312, eff 4-13-13",
